msgid "# Kimi K3.1 Pro (Experimental)"
msgstr "# Kimi K3.1 Pro（实验性）"

msgid ""
"This guide covers feature configuration, environment preparation, multi-node"
" Prefill/Decode (PD) separation, functional verification, and accuracy and "
"performance evaluation for Kimi K3.1 Pro. Deployment scenarios include basic"
" PD separation, 1M long-context PD separation, and pooled PD separation."
msgstr ""
"本指南涵盖 Kimi K3.1 Pro 的特性配置、环境准备、多节点 "
"Prefill/Decode（PD）分离部署、功能验证以及精度与性能评估。部署场景包括基础 PD 分离、1M 长上下文 PD 分离以及池化 PD 分离。"

msgid ""
"This guide covers the validated Atlas 800I A3 and 950DT Products platforms. "
"A2 and 950PR Products are not currently supported."
msgstr ""
"本指南涵盖已验证的 Atlas 800I A3 和 Ascend 950DT系列产品平台。目前不支持 A2 和 Ascend 950PR系列产品。"

msgid "## 1 Introduction {#1-introduction}"
msgstr "## 1 简介 {#1-introduction}"

msgid ""
"The PD separation deployment (including the Proxy) in this document is "
"provided only as an example/reference design to demonstrate the basic "
"process of deploying Prefill and Decode separately. It is not recommended "
"for use in production environments."
msgstr ""
"本文档中的 PD 分离部署（包括 Proxy）仅作为示例/参考设计提供，用于演示分别部署 Prefill 和 Decode "
"的基本流程。不建议在生产环境中使用。"

msgid ""
"**For the production environment on the customer side, [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM-Ascend is recommended.**"
msgstr ""
"**对于客户侧的生产环境，推荐使用 [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM-Ascend。**"

msgid ""
"Kimi K3.1 Pro is a multimodal Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) model developed by "
"Moonshot AI as an evolution of Kimi K3. It retains the hybrid attention and "
"Latent MoE architecture and introduces DSA sparse attention. The model "
"supports visual understanding and a one-million-token context, combining "
"language understanding, reasoning, and tool calling for coding, long-"
"document processing, and multi-step agent tasks."
msgstr ""
"Kimi K3.1 Pro 是 Moonshot AI 开发的多模态混合专家（MoE）模型，是 Kimi K3 的演进版本。它保留了混合注意力和 "
"Latent MoE 架构，并引入了 DSA 稀疏注意力。该模型支持视觉理解和一百万 token "
"的上下文，融合了语言理解、推理和工具调用能力，适用于编码、长文档处理和多步智能体任务。"

msgid ""
"This guide provides eight-node 4P4D basic and 1M configurations for Atlas "
"800I A3 and 950DT Products. Use the parallelism, cache types, and parsers "
"specified by each platform's templates. [Section 5.3](#53-pooled-pd) "
"provides the Atlas 800I A3 pooled reference and the 950DT Products pooled "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"本指南提供适用于 Atlas 800I A3 和 Ascend 950DT系列产品的八节点 4P4D 基础配置和 1M "
"配置。请使用各平台模板指定的并行度、缓存类型和解析器。[第 5.3 节](#53-pooled-pd)提供了 Atlas 800I A3 "
"的池化参考配置和 Ascend 950DT系列产品的池化配置。"

msgid ""
"This guide is based on **vLLM-Ascend 0.30.0**, which introduces experimental"
" support for Kimi K3.1 Pro for evaluation and validation with the "
"configurations provided here. Supported scenarios, performance, and "
"configuration interfaces may evolve in later releases."
msgstr ""
"本指南基于 **vLLM-Ascend 0.30.0**，该版本引入了对 Kimi K3.1 Pro "
"的实验性支持，可使用本文提供的配置进行评估和验证。支持的场景、性能和配置接口可能会在后续版本中发生变化。"

msgid "## 2 Supported Features {#2-supported-features}"
msgstr "## 2 支持的特性 {#2-supported-features}"

msgid ""
"Refer to [supported "
"features](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md#generative-"
"models_1) for the model's supported feature matrix."
msgstr ""
"该模型支持的特性矩阵请参阅[支持的特性](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md#generative-"
"models_1)。"

msgid ""
"Refer to the [feature guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) for "
"feature configuration."
msgstr "特性配置请参阅[特性指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)。"

msgid "## 3 Prerequisites {#3-prerequisites}"
msgstr "## 3 前提条件 {#3-prerequisites}"

msgid "### 3.1 Model Weights {#31-model-weights}"
msgstr "### 3.1 模型权重 {#31-model-weights}"

msgid "| Weight Version | Hardware Requirements | Download Links | Notes |"
msgstr "| 权重版本 | 硬件要求 | 下载链接 | 说明 |"

msgid ""
"| Kimi K3.1 Pro target model (A3)<br>`Kimi-K3.1-Pro-w4a8` | PD "
"separation:<br>8 Atlas 800I A3 servers, with 16 devices per node (64 GB × "
"16). | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Kimi-K3.1-Pro-w4a8) | Use the W4A8 quantized checkpoint for A3 with "
"`--quantization ascend`. See [Section 5](#5-online-service-deployment) for "
"the topology and loading options. |"
msgstr ""
"| Kimi K3.1 Pro 目标模型（A3）<br>`Kimi-K3.1-Pro-w4a8` | PD 分离：<br>8 台 Atlas 800I "
"A3 服务器，每节点 16 个设备（64 GB × 16）。 | "
"[ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/Kimi-K3.1-Pro-w4a8) |"
" 在 A3 上使用 W4A8 量化权重，并配合 `--quantization ascend`。拓扑和加载选项请参阅[第 5 节](#5-online-"
"service-deployment)。 |"

msgid ""
"| Kimi K3.1 Pro target model (950DT Products)<br>`Kimi-K3.1-Pro-w4a8-mxfp` |"
" PD separation:<br>8 950DT servers, with 8 devices per node. | "
"[ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Kimi-K3.1-Pro-w4a8-mxfp) | Use the W4A8_MXFP quantized checkpoint for "
"950DT Products with `--quantization ascend`. See [Section 5](#5-online-"
"service-deployment) for the topology and loading options. |"
msgstr ""
"| Kimi K3.1 Pro 目标模型（Ascend 950DT系列产品）<br>`Kimi-K3.1-Pro-w4a8-mxfp` | PD "
"分离：<br>8 台 950DT 服务器，每节点 8 个设备。 | "
"[ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Kimi-K3.1-Pro-w4a8-mxfp) | 在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上使用 W4A8_MXFP 量化权重，并配合 "
"`--quantization ascend`。拓扑和加载选项请参阅[第 5 节](#5-online-service-deployment)。 |"

msgid ""
"The target checkpoint directory must contain the model configuration, "
"tokenizer, image processor, and model weight files required by the Kimi K3.1"
" Pro release. DSpark is a speculative decoding method: a draft model "
"proposes candidate tokens, which the target model then verifies. For DSpark "
"in PD separation or pooled PD deployment, prepare a draft checkpoint "
"compatible with the platform and target model and specify its local "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"目标权重目录必须包含 Kimi K3.1 Pro 版本所需的模型配置、分词器、图像处理器和模型权重文件。DSpark "
"是一种投机解码方法：由草稿模型提出候选 token，再由目标模型进行验证。在 PD 分离或池化 PD 部署中使用 DSpark "
"时，请准备与平台和目标模型兼容的草稿权重，并指定其本地目录。"

msgid ""
"For each role, `draft_tensor_parallel_size` must match the target model's "
"`--tensor-parallel-size`; Prefill and Decode may use different TP sizes."
msgstr ""
"对于每个角色，`draft_tensor_parallel_size` 必须与目标模型的 `--tensor-parallel-size` "
"一致；Prefill 和 Decode 可以使用不同的 TP 大小。"

msgid ""
"**Paths:** Download the target checkpoint for your platform from the table "
"above. The commands below use example local directories: "
"`/root/.cache/Kimi-K3.1-Pro-w4a8` on A3 and "
"`/root/.cache/Kimi-K3.1-Pro-w4a8-mxfp` on 950DT Products. Download the "
"complete checkpoint into the corresponding directory; if you use another "
"directory, update the `vllm serve` path in every template for that platform."
" `<YOUR_DRAFT_MODEL_PATH>` still denotes the local directory of the "
"compatible DSpark draft checkpoint. Use the same paths on every node and "
"mount the weight directories inside every container. Weight directory names "
"are independent of the API service name; keep `kimi-k3.1-pro` for both the "
"served model name and the request `model` field."
msgstr ""
"**路径：** 请从上方表格下载适用于您平台的目标权重。以下命令使用示例本地目录：A3 上为 "
"`/root/.cache/Kimi-K3.1-Pro-w4a8`，Ascend 950DT系列产品上为 "
"`/root/.cache/Kimi-K3.1-Pro-w4a8-mxfp`。请将完整权重下载到对应目录；如果使用其他目录，请更新该平台所有模板中的 "
"`vllm serve` 路径。`<YOUR_DRAFT_MODEL_PATH>` 仍表示兼容的 DSpark "
"草稿权重的本地目录。请在每个节点上使用相同的路径，并在每个容器内挂载权重目录。权重目录名与 API 服务名无关；服务模型名和请求的 `model` "
"字段均保持为 `kimi-k3.1-pro`。"

msgid ""
"### 3.2 Verify Multi-node Communication {#32-verify-multi-node-"
"communication}"
msgstr "### 3.2 验证多节点通信 {#32-verify-multi-node-communication}"

msgid ""
"Before multi-node deployment, follow the [multi-node communication "
"verification guide](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-"
"multi-node) to check communication within and between nodes."
msgstr ""
"在进行多节点部署之前，请按照[多节点通信验证指南](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-"
"multi-node)检查节点内和节点间的通信。"

msgid "## 4 Installation {#4-installation}"
msgstr "## 4 安装 {#4-installation}"

msgid "### 4.1 Docker Image Installation {#41-docker-image-installation}"
msgstr "### 4.1 Docker 镜像安装 {#41-docker-image-installation}"

msgid ""
"Select an image for the deployment platform and host operating system, and "
"start a container on every node. Refer to the [installation "
"guide](../../getting_started/installation.md) for additional container "
"options."
msgstr ""
"请为部署平台和主机操作系统选择镜像，并在每个节点上启动容器。更多容器选项请参阅[安装指南](../../getting_started/installation.md)。"

msgid "Kimi K3.1 Pro is validated on Atlas 800I A3 (64 GB × 16)."
msgstr "Kimi K3.1 Pro 已在 Atlas 800I A3（64 GB × 16）上完成验证。"

msgid ""
"Select the complete command for the host operating system and run it on "
"every node. If the model directory is outside `/root/.cache/`, update the "
"mount path accordingly."
msgstr "选择适用于宿主机操作系统的完整命令，并在每个节点上运行。如果模型目录不在 `/root/.cache/` 下，请相应更新挂载路径。"

msgid "=== \"Ubuntu\""
msgstr "=== \"Ubuntu\""

msgid "=== \"openEuler\""
msgstr "=== \"openEuler\""

msgid ""
"After starting the container, run `docker ps` in another terminal and "
"confirm that the container specified by `--name` is listed with status `Up`."
" The commands above use `--rm`, which removes the container when it exits; "
"if startup fails, inspect the output in the launch terminal first. To retain"
" the exit status and logs, rerun without `--rm`, then inspect the container "
"with `docker ps -a` and `docker logs <CONTAINER_NAME>`."
msgstr ""
"启动容器后，在另一个终端中运行 `docker ps`，确认 `--name` 指定的容器已列出且状态为 `Up`。上述命令使用了 "
"`--rm`，容器退出时会被删除；如果启动失败，请先检查启动终端中的输出。如需保留退出状态和日志，请去掉 `--rm` 重新运行，然后使用 "
"`docker ps -a` 和 `docker logs <CONTAINER_NAME>` 检查容器。"

msgid ""
"The containers above use privileged mode, host networking, and writable host"
" mounts, and are intended for a controlled deployment environment. Services "
"listen on `0.0.0.0`, and the examples do not configure access "
"authentication; restrict network access to Proxy, engine, and cache service "
"ports. Save scripts, configuration, and logs that must persist in explicitly"
" mounted directories. `--rm` removes files in the container writable layer "
"but does not delete host files in bind-mounted directories."
msgstr ""
"上述容器使用特权模式、主机网络和可写的主机挂载，仅适用于受控的部署环境。服务监听在 `0.0.0.0`，示例中未配置访问认证；请限制对 "
"Proxy、引擎和缓存服务端口的网络访问。需要持久化的脚本、配置和日志请保存在显式挂载的目录中。`--rm` "
"会删除容器可写层中的文件，但不会删除绑定挂载目录中的主机文件。"

msgid "### 4.2 Source Code Installation {#42-source-code-installation}"
msgstr "### 4.2 源码安装 {#42-source-code-installation}"

msgid ""
"If you do not use the Docker images above, you can build from source. Follow"
" the [installation guide](../../getting_started/installation.md) to install "
"vLLM-Ascend and prepare the same runtime environment on every deployment "
"node."
msgstr ""
"如果不使用上述 Docker 镜像，可以从源码构建。请按照[安装指南](../../getting_started/installation.md)安装"
" vLLM-Ascend，并在每个部署节点上准备相同的运行环境。"

msgid ""
"Kimi K3.1 Pro model configuration, multimodal processing, reasoning parsing,"
" and tool-call parsing are registered by vLLM-Ascend. Use vLLM and vLLM-"
"Ascend source revisions compatible with **vLLM-Ascend 0.30.0**, the version "
"used in this guide."
msgstr ""
"Kimi K3.1 Pro 的模型配置、多模态处理、推理解析和工具调用解析由 vLLM-Ascend 注册。请使用与本指南所用版本 **vLLM-"
"Ascend 0.30.0** 兼容的 vLLM 和 vLLM-Ascend 源码版本。"

msgid "## 5 Online Service Deployment {#5-online-service-deployment}"
msgstr "## 5 在线服务部署 {#5-online-service-deployment}"

msgid ""
"This section covers basic PD separation, 1M long-context PD separation, and "
"pooled PD separation. Enable `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1` on every node, use"
" `kimi-k3.1-pro` as the served model name, and fill in model paths as "
"described in [Section 3.1](#31-model-weights). The A3 and 950DT Products "
"basic and 1M configurations follow their respective deployment scripts; the "
"A3 pooled reference and 950DT Products pooled configurations are listed in "
"[Section 5.3](#53-pooled-pd)."
msgstr ""
"本节涵盖基础 PD 分离、1M 长上下文 PD 分离和池化 PD 分离。请在每个节点上启用 "
"`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`，使用 `kimi-k3.1-pro` 作为服务模型名称，并按[第 3.1 "
"节](#31-model-weights)所述填写模型路径。Atlas A3系列产品和Ascend 950DT系列产品的基础配置和 1M "
"配置遵循各自的部署脚本；Atlas A3系列产品的池化参考配置和Ascend 950DT系列产品的池化配置列于[第 5.3 节](#53-pooled-"
"pd)。"

msgid ""
"If startup or a request fails, inspect the relevant engine and Proxy logs, "
"then consult the [public FAQ](../../faqs.md) for environment, installation, "
"and common parameter issues."
msgstr ""
"如果启动或请求失败，请检查相关引擎和 Proxy 日志，然后查阅[公开 FAQ](../../faqs.md)了解环境、安装和常见参数问题。"

msgid ""
"MegaMoE refers to the fused MoE computation path controlled by "
"`enable_fused_mc2`. Use the setting specified in each deployment template."
msgstr "MegaMoE 指由 `enable_fused_mc2` 控制的融合 MoE 计算路径。请使用各部署模板中指定的设置。"

msgid "### 5.1 Basic Multi-node PD Separation Deployment {#51-pd-deployment}"
msgstr "### 5.1 基础多节点 PD 分离部署 {#51-pd-deployment}"

msgid ""
"#### 5.1.1 Create the Engine Templates {#511-create-the-engine-templates}"
msgstr "#### 5.1.1 创建引擎模板 {#511-create-the-engine-templates}"

msgid ""
"A3 uses eight nodes in a 4P4D deployment: **PP4 / PCP4 / TP4** on Prefill, "
"with layer partition `25,25,24,19`, and **DP4 / DCP16 / TP16** on Decode. "
"Only P0 exposes the Prefill API; each of the four Decode nodes exposes its "
"own API."
msgstr ""
"A3 采用 4P4D 部署，共使用八个节点：Prefill 使用 **PP4 / PCP4 / TP4**，层划分为 "
"`25,25,24,19`；Decode 使用 **DP4 / DCP16 / TP16**。仅 P0 对外暴露 Prefill API；四个 "
"Decode 节点各自暴露自己的 API。"

msgid ""
"Both roles use Model Runner V2 and MooncakeConnectorV2, with a maximum model"
" length of `204800`. Prefill uses eager execution and a GPU memory "
"utilization setting of `0.90`, enables PCP4, and disables MegaMoE. Decode "
"uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` and a GPU memory utilization setting of `0.80`, with"
" shared-expert multistream overlap, scheduler recomputation, and MLAPO "
"enabled. Shared-expert DP is disabled on both roles."
msgstr ""
"两种角色均使用 Model Runner V2 和 MooncakeConnectorV2，最大模型长度为 `204800`。Prefill 使用 "
"eager 执行模式，GPU 显存利用率设置为 `0.90`，启用 PCP4 并禁用 MegaMoE。Decode 使用 "
"`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`，GPU 显存利用率设置为 `0.80`，并启用共享专家多流重叠、调度器重计算和 MLAPO。两种角色均禁用共享专家"
" DP。"

msgid ""
"Leave `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` unset on Prefill and set it to `AIV` on "
"Decode. Both roles use `HCCL_BUFFSIZE=1024`. The main attention cache and "
"indexer K cache use INT8, with a block size of `768`; Decode also uses an "
"interleave size of `768`. The Prefill topology in the connector "
"configuration on both roles is TP4 / PCP4 / PP4."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 上不设置 `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE`，Decode 上将其设置为 `AIV`。两种角色均使用 "
"`HCCL_BUFFSIZE=1024`。主注意力缓存和 indexer K 缓存使用 INT8，块大小为 `768`；Decode 还使用 `768`"
" 的交错大小。两种角色上连接器配置中的 Prefill 拓扑均为 TP4 / PCP4 / PP4。"

msgid ""
"DSpark3 is optional. Draft TP is 4 on Prefill and 16 on Decode and must "
"match the target TP on each role; both roles use three speculative tokens. "
"Refer to the [Mooncake PD disaggregation "
"guide](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) "
"for the general service workflow."
msgstr ""
"DSpark3 为可选项。Draft TP 在 Prefill 上为 4，在 Decode 上为 16，且必须与各角色上的目标 TP "
"匹配；两种角色均使用三个投机 token。通用服务流程请参阅 [Mooncake PD "
"分离指南](../../tutorials/features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)。"

msgid ""
"MooncakeConnectorV2 exchanges actual layer metadata through its handshake "
"and does not read `pp_layer_partition` from `kv_connector_extra_config`. "
"Keep `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=25,25,24,19` on every Prefill node for model "
"layer partitioning; leave the environment variable unset on Decode. This "
"applies to the basic, 1M, and pooled templates."
msgstr ""
"MooncakeConnectorV2 通过握手交换实际的层元数据，不会从 `kv_connector_extra_config` 读取 "
"`pp_layer_partition`。请在每个 Prefill 节点上保留 "
"`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=25,25,24,19` 用于模型层划分；在 Decode 上不设置该环境变量。这适用于基础、1M "
"和池化模板。"

msgid ""
"To enable DSpark3, replace `<YOUR_DRAFT_MODEL_PATH>` with the local "
"directory of a draft model compatible with the A3 target model. Use the same"
" draft checkpoint on both roles and the same directory path on every node."
msgstr ""
"要启用 DSpark3，请将 `<YOUR_DRAFT_MODEL_PATH>` 替换为与 A3 目标模型兼容的 draft "
"模型的本地目录。两种角色使用相同的 draft checkpoint，且每个节点使用相同的目录路径。"

msgid ""
"Save the Decode template below as `run_dp_template.sh` on each Decode node. "
"Fill in the local IP, network interface, and model path. Fill in the KV port"
" and the HCCL base port and port range for your environment (range format: "
"`start-end`), avoiding port conflicts."
msgstr ""
"在每个 Decode 节点上将下面的 Decode 模板保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。填写本地 "
"IP、网络接口和模型路径。根据你的环境填写 KV 端口以及 HCCL 基础端口和端口范围（范围格式：`start-end`），避免端口冲突。"

msgid "**Optional: Enable DSpark3**"
msgstr "**可选：启用 DSpark3**"

msgid ""
"Add the following option to the `vllm serve` command above, retaining a "
"trailing backslash if it is inserted before the last line. Enable it on both"
" roles, using the same draft checkpoint and three speculative tokens."
msgstr ""
"将以下选项添加到上面的 `vllm serve` "
"命令中，如果插入到最后一行之前，请保留行尾的反斜杠。在两个角色上都启用该选项，使用相同的草稿模型检查点和三个推测 token。"

msgid ""
"950DT Products use eight nodes in a 4P4D topology: DP1 / PP4 / PCP8 / TP1 on"
" Prefill, with layer partition `24,24,24,21`, and DP4 / TP8 / DCP8 on "
"Decode. Only P0 exposes a Prefill API; P1–P3 use `--headless`, and all four "
"Decode nodes expose APIs."
msgstr ""
"Ascend 950DT系列产品采用八节点 4P4D 拓扑：Prefill 上为 DP1 / PP4 / PCP8 / TP1，层划分为 "
"`24,24,24,21`；Decode 上为 DP4 / TP8 / DCP8。只有 P0 暴露 Prefill API；P1–P3 使用 "
"`--headless`，四个 Decode 节点均暴露 API。"

msgid ""
"Both roles use `--max-model-len 140000` in the basic configuration. The "
"target model uses W4A8_MXFP weights with `--quantization ascend`; the main "
"attention and indexer K caches use FP8. Both roles enable Model Runner V2 "
"and CCU communication (`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=CCU_SCHED`), with "
"`HCCL_BUFFSIZE` set to `2000/800` on Prefill/Decode."
msgstr ""
"在基础配置中，两个角色都使用 `--max-model-len 140000`。目标模型使用 W4A8_MXFP 权重，并配合 "
"`--quantization ascend`；主注意力和 indexer K 缓存使用 FP8。两个角色都启用 Model Runner V2 和 "
"CCU 通信（`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=CCU_SCHED`），Prefill/Decode 上的 `HCCL_BUFFSIZE`"
" 分别设置为 `2000/800`。"

msgid ""
"Prefill uses eager execution, memory utilization `0.90`, a batched-token "
"limit of `16384`, and a sequence limit of `64`, with "
"`enable_flashcomm1=true`, `enable_shared_expert_dp=true`, and MegaMoE "
"disabled. Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`, memory utilization `0.92`, a "
"batched-token limit of `768`, and a sequence limit of `64`, with MLAPO, "
"shared-expert multistream overlap, and scheduler recomputation enabled. Both"
" roles use block size and interleave size `1536`."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 使用 eager 执行，内存利用率为 `0.90`，批处理 token 上限为 `16384`，序列上限为 `64`，并设置 "
"`enable_flashcomm1=true`、`enable_shared_expert_dp=true`，同时禁用 MegaMoE。Decode "
"使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`，内存利用率为 `0.92`，批处理 token 上限为 `768`，序列上限为 `64`，并启用 "
"MLAPO、共享专家多流重叠和调度器重计算。两个角色的 block size 和 interleave size 均为 `1536`。"

msgid ""
"Prefill retains `enable_flashcomm1=true` in this section. The current TP1 "
"configuration does not meet the TP > 1 requirement for generic MoE sequence "
"parallelism or shared-expert DP, so the configured values do not imply that "
"these paths are active; check startup logs for the matching version. All "
"950DT Products templates configure MLAPO through `--additional-config`: "
"`enable_mlapo=false` on Prefill and `enable_mlapo=true` on Decode."
msgstr ""
"本节中 Prefill 保留 `enable_flashcomm1=true`。当前 TP1 配置不满足通用 MoE 序列并行或共享专家 DP 所需的 "
"TP > 1 要求，因此所配置的值并不表示这些路径已生效；请查看启动日志以确认对应版本。所有 Ascend 950DT系列产品模板都通过 "
"`--additional-config` 配置 MLAPO：Prefill 上为 `enable_mlapo=false`，Decode 上为 "
"`enable_mlapo=true`。"

msgid ""
"Save the Decode template below as `run_dp_template.sh` on the corresponding "
"nodes. Fill in the local IP, network interface, KV port, and target and "
"draft model paths, and replace `<PROFILER_OUTPUT_DIR>` with a writable "
"profiling output directory."
msgstr ""
"在相应节点上将下面的 Decode 模板保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。填写本地 IP、网络接口、KV "
"端口以及目标模型和草稿模型路径，并将 `<PROFILER_OUTPUT_DIR>` 替换为可写的性能分析输出目录。"

msgid "**Key deployment parameters:**"
msgstr "**关键部署参数：**"

msgid "| Parameter | Description and tuning guidance |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 说明与调优指导 |"

msgid ""
"| `--tensor-parallel-size` / `--data-parallel-size` / `--pipeline-parallel-"
"size` | Control tensor, data and pipeline parallelism. Update node "
"assignments, launcher arguments and the P/D connector topology together when"
" changing these values. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--tensor-parallel-size` / `--data-parallel-size` / `--pipeline-parallel-"
"size` | 控制张量并行、数据并行和流水线并行。更改这些值时，需同时更新节点分配、启动器参数和 P/D 连接器拓扑。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--prefill-context-parallel-size` / `--decode-context-parallel-size` | "
"Control Prefill and Decode context parallelism. Choose values for the device"
" topology and long-sequence cache requirements, keeping TP, PP and connector"
" settings consistent. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--prefill-context-parallel-size` / `--decode-context-parallel-size` | 控制 "
"Prefill 和 Decode 的上下文并行。根据设备拓扑和长序列缓存需求选择取值，并保持 TP、PP 和连接器设置一致。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-model-len` | Limit the total input and output tokens per request. "
"Check KV cache capacity before increasing this limit and reserve room for "
"generated output. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--max-model-len` | 限制每个请求的输入和输出 token 总数。提高该限制前请检查 KV 缓存容量，并为生成的输出预留空间。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-num-seqs` | Limit the number of sequences processed in a scheduling"
" iteration. Increasing this value can improve concurrent throughput but also"
" increase cache usage and request latency. |"
msgstr "| `--max-num-seqs` | 限制单个调度迭代中处理的序列数量。增大该值可提升并发吞吐量，但也会增加缓存占用和请求延迟。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-num-batched-tokens` | Set the token budget per scheduling "
"iteration. Tune it for input length and concurrency, comparing throughput, "
"time to first token and time per output token. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--max-num-batched-tokens` | 设置每个调度迭代的 token 预算。根据输入长度和并发度进行调优，并对比吞吐量、首 "
"token 时延和每输出 token 时延。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--gpu-memory-utilization` | Set the fraction of device memory budgeted "
"for the model executor. A larger budget can leave more space for KV cache; "
"retain runtime headroom and check for out-of-memory errors. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--gpu-memory-utilization` | 设置分配给模型执行器的设备内存比例。更大的预算可为 KV "
"缓存留出更多空间；请保留运行时余量并检查是否出现内存不足错误。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-prefix-caching` | Allow KV cache reuse for matching prefixes. "
"Record cold or warm cache state when benchmarking to make results "
"comparable. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--enable-prefix-caching` | 允许对匹配的前缀复用 KV 缓存。进行基准测试时请记录冷缓存或热缓存状态，以保证结果可比。 "
"|"

msgid ""
"| `--enforce-eager` / `--compilation-config` | Select eager or graph "
"execution. The templates use eager Prefill and `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` Decode; "
"recheck memory usage and performance after changing modes. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--enforce-eager` / `--compilation-config` | 选择 eager 执行或图执行。模板使用 eager "
"Prefill 和 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` Decode；更改模式后请重新检查内存占用和性能。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--kv-cache-dtype` / `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype` | Set the main "
"attention KV cache and indexer K cache types. Keep a platform-supported "
"combination and validate accuracy and cache capacity after changes. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--kv-cache-dtype` / `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype` | 设置主注意力 KV 缓存和"
" indexer K 缓存的类型。请使用平台支持的组合，并在更改后验证精度和缓存容量。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--block-size` / `--cp-kv-cache-interleave-size` | Control KV cache block "
"size and token interleaving granularity for context parallelism. Use the "
"platform template values and check P/D cache layout and connector "
"compatibility before changing them. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--block-size` / `--cp-kv-cache-interleave-size` | 控制 KV 缓存 block size "
"以及上下文并行的 token 交织粒度。请使用平台模板中的取值，更改前请检查 P/D 缓存布局和连接器兼容性。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--speculative-config` | Configure the DSpark draft model and speculative "
"token count. Draft TP must equal target-model TP for each role; evaluate "
"gains using acceptance rate and end-to-end throughput. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--speculative-config` | 配置 DSpark 草稿模型和推测 token 数量。每个角色上的草稿 TP 必须等于目标模型 "
"TP；请使用接受率和端到端吞吐量评估收益。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-expert-parallel` / `--additional-config` | Control expert "
"parallelism and platform optimization options. Start from the template for "
"each platform and role, then change and measure one option at a time. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--enable-expert-parallel` / `--additional-config` | "
"控制专家并行和平台优化选项。从各平台和角色的模板开始，然后每次只修改并测量一个选项。 |"

msgid ""
"#### 5.1.2 Start the Engines and Proxy {#512-start-the-engines-and-proxy}"
msgstr "#### 5.1.2 启动引擎和代理 {#512-start-the-engines-and-proxy}"

msgid ""
"The Decode launcher is located at [`vllm-"
"ascend/examples/external_online_dp/launch_online_dp.py`](https://github.com/vllm-"
