msgid ""
"### 5.2 Long-Context and 1M PD Separation Deployment {#52-long-context}"
msgstr "### 5.2 长上下文与 1M PD 分离部署 {#52-long-context}"

msgid ""
"#### 5.2.1 Create the Engine Templates {#521-create-the-engine-templates}"
msgstr "#### 5.2.1 创建引擎模板 {#521-create-the-engine-templates}"

msgid ""
"A3 1M deployment uses the same eight-node 4P4D topology as [Section "
"5.1](#51-pd-deployment): PP4 / PCP4 / TP4 on Prefill and DP4 / DCP16 / TP16 "
"on Decode. The basic configuration already enables DCP16. Change only "
"`--max-model-len` to `1048576` on both roles and keep all other settings "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"A3 1M 部署使用与[第 5.1 节](#51-pd-deployment)相同的八节点 4P4D 拓扑：Prefill 上为 PP4 / PCP4 "
"/ TP4，Decode 上为 DP4 / DCP16 / TP16。基础配置已启用 DCP16。只需将两个角色上的 `--max-model-len`"
" 改为 `1048576`，其余设置保持不变。"

msgid ""
"To enable DSpark3, replace `<YOUR_DRAFT_MODEL_PATH>` with the local "
"directory of a draft model compatible with the A3 target model and add the "
"role-specific options from [Section 5.1](#51-pd-deployment). Use the same "
"draft checkpoint on both roles and the same directory path on every node. "
"Complete Prefill and Decode templates and launch and verification "
"instructions are provided below."
msgstr ""
"要启用 DSpark3，请将 `<YOUR_DRAFT_MODEL_PATH>` 替换为与 A3 目标模型兼容的 draft 模型的本地目录，并添加[第"
" 5.1 节](#51-pd-deployment)中特定于角色的选项。两个角色使用相同的 draft "
"checkpoint，每个节点使用相同的目录路径。完整的 Prefill 和 Decode 模板以及启动和验证说明见下文。"

msgid ""
"Save the 1M Decode template below as `run_dp_template.sh` on each Decode "
"node. Fill in the local IP, network interface, model path, KV port, and HCCL"
" port settings as described in [Section 5.1.1](#511-create-the-engine-"
"templates)."
msgstr ""
"将下面的 1M Decode 模板保存为每个 Decode 节点上的 `run_dp_template.sh`。按照[第 5.1.1 "
"节](#511-create-the-engine-templates)所述填写本地 IP、网络接口、模型路径、KV 端口和 HCCL 端口设置。"

msgid ""
"950DT Products 1M deployment uses the basic eight-node 4P4D topology: DP1 / "
"PP4 / PCP8 / TP1 on Prefill and DP4 / TP8 / DCP8 on Decode. Set `--max-"
"model-len 1048576` on both Prefill and Decode and retain the other basic "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Ascend 950DT系列产品 1M 部署使用基础八节点 4P4D 拓扑：Prefill 上为 DP1 / PP4 / PCP8 / "
"TP1，Decode 上为 DP4 / TP8 / DCP8。在 Prefill 和 Decode 上均设置 `--max-model-len "
"1048576`，并保留其他基础设置。"

msgid ""
"The 1M limit includes both input and output tokens. Reserve space for the "
"generated response."
msgstr "1M 限制包含输入和输出 token。请为生成的响应预留空间。"

msgid ""
"The 950DT Products basic and 1M templates enable DSpark3 with the same draft"
" checkpoint on both roles, draft TP `1/8` on Prefill/Decode matching the "
"target TP on each role, three speculative tokens, draft "
"`enforce_eager=false`, and `kv_cache_dtype=auto`. The Prefill target model "
"retains `--enforce-eager`. Replace `<YOUR_DRAFT_MODEL_PATH>` with the local "
"directory of a draft checkpoint compatible with the target model on this "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"Ascend 950DT系列产品的基础模板和 1M 模板均启用 DSpark3，两个角色使用相同的 draft "
"checkpoint，Prefill/Decode 上的 draft TP 分别为 `1/8`，与各角色上的目标 TP 匹配，使用三个投机 "
"token，draft `enforce_eager=false`，以及 `kv_cache_dtype=auto`。Prefill 目标模型保留 "
"`--enforce-eager`。请将 `<YOUR_DRAFT_MODEL_PATH>` 替换为与该平台上目标模型兼容的 draft "
"checkpoint 的本地目录。"

msgid ""
"The templates use `--tokenizer-mode kimi_k3`. For reasoning parsing and tool"
" calling, also configure `--reasoning-parser kimi_k3`, `--tool-call-parser "
"kimi_k3`, and `--enable-auto-tool-choice` together as described in [Section "
"10](#10-faq)."
msgstr ""
"模板使用 `--tokenizer-mode kimi_k3`。对于推理解析和工具调用，还需按照[第 10 节](#10-faq)所述，同时配置 "
"`--reasoning-parser kimi_k3`、`--tool-call-parser kimi_k3` 和 `--enable-auto-"
"tool-choice`。"

msgid ""
"Fill in a unique `<PREFILL_ENGINE_ID>` or `<DECODE_ENGINE_ID>` for each "
"engine. Use distinct node ranks for P0–P3; the template automatically adds "
"`--headless` on P1–P3."
msgstr ""
"为每个引擎填写唯一的 `<PREFILL_ENGINE_ID>` 或 `<DECODE_ENGINE_ID>`。为 P0–P3 使用不同的节点 "
"rank；模板会自动在 P1–P3 上添加 `--headless`。"

msgid ""
"Save the 1M Decode template below as `run_dp_template.sh` on the "
"corresponding nodes. Fill in the local IP, network interface, KV port, and "
"target and draft model paths, and replace `<PROFILER_OUTPUT_DIR>` with a "
"writable profiling output directory."
msgstr ""
"将下方的 1M Decode 模板保存为相应节点上的 `run_dp_template.sh`。填写本地 IP、网络接口、KV "
"端口以及目标模型和草稿模型路径，并将 `<PROFILER_OUTPUT_DIR>` 替换为可写的性能分析输出目录。"

msgid ""
"#### 5.2.2 Start and Verify the Service {#522-start-and-verify-the-service}"
msgstr "#### 5.2.2 启动并验证服务 {#522-start-and-verify-the-service}"

msgid ""
"Using the 1M templates above, follow [Section 5.1.2](#512-start-the-engines-"
"and-proxy) to run Bash directly on each P node and the Python launcher on "
"each D node, then start the Proxy."
msgstr ""
"使用上述 1M 模板，按照[第 5.1.2 节](#512-start-the-engines-and-proxy)在每个 P 节点上直接运行 "
"Bash，在每个 D 节点上运行 Python 启动器，然后启动 Proxy。"

msgid ""
"Check the logs for model length `1048576`, PCP4 / TP4 on Prefill, and DCP16 "
"/ TP16 on Decode. First check the service and complete a short request as "
"described in [Section 6](#6-functional-verification), then validate long "
"requests through the Proxy. Total input and output tokens must remain within"
" the configured limit. Record the actual lengths, concurrency, memory usage,"
" and request completion status."
msgstr ""
"检查日志中的模型长度 `1048576`、Prefill 上的 PCP4 / TP4 以及 Decode 上的 DCP16 / TP16。首先按照[第 "
"6 节](#6-functional-verification)检查服务并完成一个短请求，然后通过 Proxy 验证长请求。输入和输出 token "
"总数必须保持在配置的限制之内。记录实际长度、并发数、内存使用量和请求完成状态。"

msgid ""
"Using the 1M templates above, follow [Section 5.1.2](#512-start-the-engines-"
"and-proxy) to run Bash directly on each P node and the Python launcher on "
"each D node, then start the Proxy. Check maximum length `1048576` on both "
"roles and DCP8 on Decode; validate a short request before testing long "
"sequences through the Proxy."
msgstr ""
"使用上述 1M 模板，按照[第 5.1.2 节](#512-start-the-engines-and-proxy)在每个 P 节点上直接运行 "
"Bash，在每个 D 节点上运行 Python 启动器，然后启动 Proxy。检查两种角色上的最大长度 `1048576` 以及 Decode 上的 "
"DCP8；在通过 Proxy 测试长序列之前，先验证一个短请求。"

msgid "### 5.3 Pooled PD Separation Deployment {#53-pooled-pd}"
msgstr "### 5.3 池化 PD 分离部署 {#53-pooled-pd}"

msgid ""
"The pooling flow differs by platform: A3 uses a separate MetaService, eight "
"standalone MemCache providers, and zero-capacity engine clients. 950DT "
"Products uses the same MetaService startup procedure without standalone "
"providers. See [Section 5.3.2](#532-prepare-the-memcache-configuration-"
"files) for configuration."
msgstr ""
"池化流程因平台而异：A3 使用独立的 MetaService、八个独立 MemCache provider 以及零容量引擎客户端。Ascend "
"950DT系列产品使用相同的 MetaService 启动流程，但不使用独立 provider。配置请参见[第 5.3.2 "
"节](#532-prepare-the-memcache-configuration-files)。"

msgid ""
"The supplied A3 reference uses eight nodes with **DP1 / PP4 / PCP4 / TP4 / "
"DCP1** on Prefill and **DP4 / PP1 / PCP1 / TP16 / DCP16** on Decode. Both "
"roles use a maximum model length of `1048576`, INT8 attention/indexer "
"caches, DSpark3, and non-layerwise pool transfer (`use_layerwise=false`). "
"The pooled example uses a separate MetaService host and one 1 GiB DRAM "
"provider per P/D node. The 950DT Products engine templates below follow "
"[Section 5.1.1](#511-create-the-engine-templates); see [Section "
"5.3.5](#535-create-the-engine-templates) for their lookup identifier "
"assignments."
msgstr ""
"提供的 A3 参考配置使用八个节点，Prefill 上为 **DP1 / PP4 / PCP4 / TP4 / DCP1**，Decode 上为 "
"**DP4 / PP1 / PCP1 / TP16 / DCP16**。两种角色均使用最大模型长度 `1048576`、INT8 "
"attention/indexer 缓存、DSpark3 以及非分层池传输（`use_layerwise=false`）。池化示例使用独立的 "
"MetaService 主机，每个 P/D 节点使用一个 1 GiB DRAM provider。下方的 Ascend "
"950DT系列产品引擎模板遵循[第 5.1.1 节](#511-create-the-engine-templates)；其查找标识符分配请参见[第 "
"5.3.5 节](#535-create-the-engine-templates)。"

msgid ""
"These are supplied deployment references. Environment readiness does not "
"establish model-side pool hits, output correctness, or performance. Verify "
"those on the deployed runtime as described in [Section 5.3.7](#537-verify-"
"the-pool-and-model-service). The A3 reference retains different P/D TP "
"sizes; the equal-TP settings in the K3 templates are not a universal pooling"
" requirement. Do not infer support for another cache layout from this "
"reference."
msgstr ""
"这些是提供的部署参考。环境就绪并不代表模型侧池命中、输出正确性或性能已得到验证。请按照[第 5.3.7 节](#537-verify-the-pool-"
"and-model-service)所述在已部署的运行时上验证这些内容。A3 参考配置保留了不同的 P/D TP 大小；K3 模板中的等 TP "
"设置并非通用的池化要求。不要根据此参考推断支持其他缓存布局。"

msgid "#### 5.3.1 Prepare the MF Components {#531-prepare-the-mf-components}"
msgstr "#### 5.3.1 准备 MF 组件 {#531-prepare-the-mf-components}"

msgid ""
"Use the model environment prepared in [Section 4](#4-installation). The "
"supplied A3 environment uses `memcache_hybrid==1.3.0` and "
"`memfabric_hybrid==1.3.0`. Check the packages with the same Python "
"environment used by vLLM:"
msgstr ""
"使用在[第 4 节](#4-installation)中准备的模型环境。提供的 A3 环境使用 `memcache_hybrid==1.3.0` 和 "
"`memfabric_hybrid==1.3.0`。使用与 vLLM 相同的 Python 环境检查这些软件包："

msgid ""
"If these compatible versions are missing, install them in that environment:"
msgstr "如果缺少这些兼容版本，请在该环境中安装它们："

msgid ""
"For offline installation or a source build, follow the [MemCache "
"installation "
"guide](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/blob/master/doc/install_run.md). "
"See the [KV Cache Pool deployment "
"guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) for "
"additional backend and platform requirements."
msgstr ""
"如需离线安装或从源码构建，请遵循 [MemCache "
"安装指南](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/blob/master/doc/install_run.md)。其他后端和平台要求请参见"
" [KV Cache Pool "
"部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)。"

msgid ""
"Choose an absolute working directory, represented by "
"`<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>`, on every provider and engine node and on the "
"MetaService host. Keep the following files there; this need not be the "
"package installation directory:"
msgstr ""
"在每个 provider 和引擎节点以及 MetaService 主机上选择一个绝对工作目录，用 `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>` "
"表示。将以下文件放在该目录中；该目录不必是软件包安装目录："

msgid "| File | Purpose |"
msgstr "| 文件 | 用途 |"

msgid ""
"    | `runtime_env.sh` | Select the Python interpreter, add package "
"libraries to `LD_LIBRARY_PATH`, and set `PYTHONHASHSEED=0` |"
msgstr ""
"    | `runtime_env.sh` | 选择 Python 解释器，将软件包库添加到 `LD_LIBRARY_PATH`，并设置 "
"`PYTHONHASHSEED=0` |"

msgid ""
"    | `mmc-meta.conf` | MetaService configuration; needed only on the "
"MetaService host |"
msgstr "    | `mmc-meta.conf` | MetaService 配置；仅在 MetaService 主机上需要 |"

msgid ""
"    | `mmc-local-standalone.conf` | Standalone provider configuration, with "
"DRAM capacity |"
msgstr "    | `mmc-local-standalone.conf` | 独立 provider 配置，包含 DRAM 容量 |"

msgid ""
"    | `mmc-local.conf` | Engine client configuration, with `dram.size=0GB` |"
msgstr "    | `mmc-local.conf` | 引擎客户端配置，包含 `dram.size=0GB` |"

msgid ""
"    | `memcache_standalone.py` | Start and keep the standalone provider "
"running |"
msgstr "    | `memcache_standalone.py` | 启动并保持独立 provider 运行 |"

msgid ""
"Save the following as `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/runtime_env.sh`. Set "
"`MEMC_PYTHON` before sourcing it if the interpreter is not `python3`. Both "
"packages must be installed in the selected interpreter's environment:"
msgstr ""
"将以下内容保存为 `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/runtime_env.sh`。如果解释器不是 `python3`，请在 source "
"之前设置 `MEMC_PYTHON`。两个软件包都必须安装在所选解释器的环境中："

msgid ""
"Check imports from the actual engine launch directory as well as a neutral "
"directory such as `/tmp`. A local directory named `vllm_ascend` can shadow "
"an editable installation:"
msgstr "请从实际的引擎启动目录以及 `/tmp` 等中性目录检查导入情况。名为 `vllm_ascend` 的本地目录可能会遮蔽可编辑安装："

msgid "For A3, expose all 16 logical NPU devices to each node's container."
msgstr "对于 A3，将全部 16 个逻辑 NPU 设备暴露给每个节点的容器。"

msgid ""
"Use MF package versions compatible with 950DT Products. On the MetaService "
"host, prepare `runtime_env.sh` as shown in the A3 tab and select a Python "
"environment with the matching packages installed. Standalone-provider files "
"and startup steps apply only to A3. Use the prepared model and MF runtime "
"environment on P/D nodes; set each node configuration path explicitly in "
"[Section 5.3.6](#536-start-the-engines-and-proxy)."
msgstr ""
"使用与Ascend 950DT系列产品兼容的 MF 包版本。在 MetaService 主机上，按照 A3 标签页所示准备 "
"`runtime_env.sh`，并选择已安装匹配包的 Python 环境。独立 provider 文件和启动步骤仅适用于 A3。在 P/D "
"节点上使用已准备好的模型和 MF 运行时环境；在[第 5.3.6 节](#536-start-the-engines-and-"
"proxy)中显式设置每个节点的配置路径。"

msgid ""
"#### 5.3.2 Prepare the MemCache Configuration Files {#532-prepare-the-"
"memcache-configuration-files}"
msgstr ""
"#### 5.3.2 准备 MemCache 配置文件 {#532-prepare-the-memcache-configuration-files}"

msgid ""
"This guide uses `ock.mmc.local_service.dram.size=1GB` by default. It "
"specifies the host DRAM capacity contributed to the cache pool by one "
"MemCache LocalService instance, not NPU memory or total cluster capacity. "
"Size it for the available memory on your machine, reserving resources for "
"the model, operating system, and other processes. See the [MemCache "
"configuration documentation](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache) for "
"adjustments. A3 standalone providers use this default, while engine clients "
"retain `dram.size=0GB` to avoid duplicate allocations. 950DT Products node "
"configurations use `1GB`."
msgstr ""
"本指南默认使用 `ock.mmc.local_service.dram.size=1GB`。该参数指定单个 MemCache LocalService "
"实例贡献给缓存池的主机 DRAM 容量，而非 NPU "
"内存或集群总容量。请根据您机器上的可用内存进行设置，并为模型、操作系统和其他进程预留资源。调整方法请参阅 [MemCache "
"配置文档](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache)。A3 独立 provider 使用此默认值，而引擎客户端保留 "
"`dram.size=0GB` 以避免重复分配。Ascend 950DT系列产品节点配置使用 `1GB`。"

msgid ""
"Select one MetaService host, which may be separate from the eight model "
"nodes. Create `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/mmc-meta.conf` on that host. The "
"supplied environment uses ports `5000`, `6000`, and `8099`:"
msgstr ""
"选择一台 MetaService 主机，该主机可以与八个模型节点分开。在该主机上创建 `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/mmc-"
"meta.conf`。所提供的环境使用端口 `5000`、`6000` 和 `8099`："

msgid ""
"On every P/D node, create `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/mmc-local.conf` for the "
"**engine clients**. Use the same MetaService address everywhere:"
msgstr ""
"在每个 P/D 节点上，为**引擎客户端**创建 `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/mmc-local.conf`。在所有位置使用相同的 "
"MetaService 地址："

msgid ""
"Use "
"[mem_scan.py](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memfabric_hybrid/blob/master/src/smem/python/memfabric_hybrid/memfabric_hybrid/mem_scan.py)"
" to determine each node's available memory after reserving resources for the"
" model and operating system. Create `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/mmc-local-"
"standalone.conf` for the **standalone provider** on every node. The example "
"below assumes at least 1 GiB of memory is available for the pool; adjust its"
" DRAM capacity to the memory available on that node:"
msgstr ""
"使用 "
"[mem_scan.py](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memfabric_hybrid/blob/master/src/smem/python/memfabric_hybrid/memfabric_hybrid/mem_scan.py)"
" 确定在为模型和操作系统预留资源后每个节点的可用内存。在每个节点上为**独立 provider** 创建 "
"`<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/mmc-local-standalone.conf`。以下示例假设池至少有 1 GiB "
"可用内存；请根据该节点上的可用内存调整其 DRAM 容量："

msgid ""
"`world_size=256` is the LocalService communication capacity, not the number "
"of standalone providers to start. The reference starts one provider on each "
"of the eight P/D nodes. Its eight 1 GiB DRAM segments total `8589934592` "
"bytes (8 GiB)."
msgstr ""
"`world_size=256` 是 LocalService 的通信容量，而非要启动的独立 provider 数量。参考配置在八个 P/D "
"节点上各启动一个 provider。其八个 1 GiB DRAM 段总计 `8589934592` 字节（8 GiB）。"

msgid ""
"Prepare `nodes/<NODE_NAME>/mmc-local.conf` on each of the eight nodes, "
"setting DRAM capacity as described in this section. At startup, set "
"`MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` to the absolute path of the local node configuration"
" file, as shown in [Section 5.3.6](#536-start-the-engines-and-proxy)."
msgstr ""
"在八个节点上分别准备 `nodes/<NODE_NAME>/mmc-local.conf`，并按照本节所述设置 DRAM 容量。启动时，将 "
"`MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 设置为本地节点配置文件的绝对路径，如[第 5.3.6 节](#536-start-the-"
"engines-and-proxy)所示。"

msgid ""
"Set the MetaService address, transport protocol, and other fields to match "
"the deployment environment."
msgstr "设置 MetaService 地址、传输协议及其他字段，使其与部署环境相匹配。"

msgid ""
"Create the MetaService `mmc-meta.conf` using the A3 tab as a reference. Set "
"addresses and ports for your environment and keep them consistent across all"
" node configurations."
msgstr ""
"参考 A3 标签页创建 MetaService 的 `mmc-meta.conf`。根据您的环境设置地址和端口，并在所有节点配置中保持一致。"

msgid "#### 5.3.3 Start MetaService {#533-start-metaservice}"
msgstr "#### 5.3.3 启动 MetaService {#533-start-metaservice}"

msgid ""
"Check for an existing MetaService before starting a new one. On the selected"
" MetaService host, source the runtime environment and select the metadata "
"configuration:"
msgstr ""
"在启动新的 MetaService 之前，请检查是否已存在 MetaService。在选定的 MetaService "
"主机上，加载运行时环境并选择元数据配置："

msgid ""
"Keep the process running. All P/D nodes must reach the configured "
"MetaService on TCP ports `5000` and `6000`; query metrics on port `8099`. "
"Update every configuration if the addresses or ports change. Reuse an "
"existing healthy MetaService without restarting it as part of a single "
"provider's startup."
msgstr ""
"保持该进程运行。所有 P/D 节点必须能够通过 TCP 端口 `5000` 和 `6000` 访问配置的 MetaService；在端口 `8099` "
"上查询指标。如果地址或端口发生变化，请更新所有配置。复用现有的健康 MetaService，不要将其重启作为单个 provider 启动的一部分。"

msgid ""
"Following the A3 procedure, load the runtime environment and select the "
"metadata configuration on the chosen MetaService host, then start the "
"service:"
msgstr "按照 A3 的流程，在选定的 MetaService 主机上加载运行时环境并选择元数据配置，然后启动服务："

msgid ""
"Keep the process running and ensure all P/D nodes can reach the configured "
"MetaService address and ports. Reuse an existing healthy service. This step "
"starts only MetaService, without per-node standalone MMC processes."
msgstr ""
"保持该进程运行，并确保所有 P/D 节点能够访问配置的 MetaService 地址和端口。复用现有的健康服务。此步骤仅启动 "
"MetaService，不启动各节点的独立 MMC 进程。"

msgid ""
"#### 5.3.4 Start the Standalone MemCache Processes {#534-start-the-"
"standalone-memcache-processes}"
msgstr ""
"#### 5.3.4 启动独立 MemCache 进程 {#534-start-the-standalone-memcache-processes}"

msgid ""
"Save the following as `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/memcache_standalone.py` on "
"every P/D node:"
msgstr "将以下内容保存为每个 P/D 节点上的 `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/memcache_standalone.py`："

msgid ""
"After confirming that no existing provider uses the same resources, start "
"**one** standalone provider per node in a separate shell:"
msgstr "在确认没有现有 provider 使用相同资源后，在单独的 shell 中为每个节点启动**一个**独立 provider："

msgid ""
"Wait for `Successfully initialized memcache.` on all eight nodes. Confirm "
"that each process is still alive and that MetaService reports the expected "
"registered DRAM capacity before starting the engines."
msgstr ""
"等待所有八个节点上出现 `Successfully initialized memcache.`。在启动引擎之前，确认每个进程仍然存活，并且 "
"MetaService 报告了预期的已注册 DRAM 容量。"

msgid ""
"The provider uses `mmc-local-standalone.conf`; each vLLM engine must use "
"`mmc-local.conf`. Passing the provider configuration to engine workers can "
"allocate DRAM repeatedly."
msgstr ""
"provider 使用 `mmc-local-standalone.conf`；每个 vLLM 引擎必须使用 `mmc-local.conf`。将 "
"provider 配置传递给引擎 worker 可能导致 DRAM 被重复分配。"

msgid ""
"Skip this step for 950DT Products. Once MetaService is ready, start the P/D "
"engines as described in [Section 5.3.6](#536-start-the-engines-and-proxy)."
msgstr ""
"Ascend 950DT系列产品请跳过此步骤。MetaService 就绪后，按照[第 5.3.6 节](#536-start-the-engines-"
"and-proxy)所述启动 P/D 引擎。"

msgid ""
"#### 5.3.5 Create the Engine Templates {#535-create-the-engine-templates}"
msgstr "#### 5.3.5 创建引擎模板 {#535-create-the-engine-templates}"

msgid ""
"Prefill sets its PP node rank and master address/port through script "
"variables and starts directly with Bash. Decode retains the launcher's seven"
" positional arguments. Use the pooled template for each role and consistent "
"model paths on all nodes."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 通过脚本变量设置其 PP 节点 rank 和 master 地址/端口，并直接使用 Bash 启动。Decode "
"保留启动器的七个位置参数。为每个角色使用池化模板，并在所有节点上使用一致的模型路径。"

msgid ""
"Fill in the A3 pooled templates' KV ports, lookup identifiers, HCCL ports, "
"and profiling directory for your environment. Reference values are "
"`33100/33500` for `<PREFILL_KV_PORT>` / `<DECODE_KV_PORT>`, `33101/33501` "
"for `<PREFILL_LOOKUP_RPC_PORT>` / `<DECODE_LOOKUP_RPC_PORT>`, and Prefill "
"HCCL base port `45000` with range `45000-45511`. Avoid service-port "
"conflicts on the same host and use a writable `<PROFILER_OUTPUT_DIR>`."
msgstr ""
"根据您的环境填写 A3 池化模板的 KV 端口、查找标识符、HCCL 端口和 profiling 目录。参考值为：`<PREFILL_KV_PORT>`"
" / `<DECODE_KV_PORT>` 使用 `33100/33500`，`<PREFILL_LOOKUP_RPC_PORT>` / "
"`<DECODE_LOOKUP_RPC_PORT>` 使用 `33101/33501`，Prefill HCCL 基础端口为 `45000`，范围为 "
"`45000-45511`。避免同一主机上的服务端口冲突，并使用可写的 `<PROFILER_OUTPUT_DIR>`。"

msgid ""
"The reference uses the same compatible DSpark draft checkpoint on both "
"roles, with three speculative tokens and BF16 draft caches. Draft TP is 4 on"
" Prefill and 16 on Decode; the Prefill draft uses eager execution and the "
"Decode draft uses `enforce_eager=false`. Fill in the local directory of a "
"draft checkpoint compatible with the A3 target model."
msgstr ""
"参考配置在两个角色上使用相同的兼容 DSpark 草稿检查点，使用三个投机 token 和 BF16 草稿缓存。Prefill 上的草稿 TP 为 "
"4，Decode 上的草稿 TP 为 16；Prefill 草稿使用 eager 执行，Decode 草稿使用 "
"`enforce_eager=false`。请填写与 A3 目标模型兼容的草稿检查点的本地目录。"

msgid ""
"The 950DT Products pooled templates use `MultiConnector` with "
"`MooncakeConnectorV2` and `AscendStoreConnector`, and set "
"`use_layerwise=false`. They inherit `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` from the launch "
"environment, preserving the node configuration path set in [Section "
"5.3.2](#532-prepare-the-memcache-configuration-files)."
msgstr ""
"Ascend 950DT系列产品的池化模板使用 `MultiConnector`，搭配 `MooncakeConnectorV2` 和 "
"`AscendStoreConnector`，并设置 `use_layerwise=false`。它们从启动环境继承 "
"`MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`，保留在[第 5.3.2 节](#532-prepare-the-memcache-"
"configuration-files)中设置的节点配置路径。"

msgid ""
"See [Section 5.3.7](#537-verify-the-pool-and-model-service) for "
"configuration and cache verification after startup."
msgstr "有关启动后的配置和缓存验证，请参见[第 5.3.7 节](#537-verify-the-pool-and-model-service)。"

msgid "!!! note \"Lookup Identifier Assignments\""
msgstr "!!! note \"Lookup 标识符分配\""

msgid ""
"The 950DT Products pooled launch commands follow [Section "
"5.1.1](#511-create-the-engine-templates): DP1 / PP4 / PCP8 / TP1 on Prefill "
"and DP4 / TP8 / DCP8 on Decode, with matching connector topology. Both roles"
" use maximum length `172032`. All four PP4 Prefill nodes use "
"`LOOKUP_RPC_PORT=0`. The four DP4 Decode nodes use `4/5/6/7` for DP ranks "
"`0/1/2/3`, respectively, calculated as `$4 + 4` in the template. These "
"lookup identifiers identify local IPC endpoints, not PP ranks or MemCache "
"registration ranks."
msgstr ""
"Ascend 950DT系列产品的池化启动命令遵循[第 5.1.1 节](#511-create-the-engine-"
"templates)：Prefill 上为 DP1 / PP4 / PCP8 / TP1，Decode 上为 DP4 / TP8 / "
"DCP8，并使用匹配的连接器拓扑。两个角色均使用最大长度 `172032`。所有四个 PP4 Prefill 节点均使用 "
"`LOOKUP_RPC_PORT=0`。四个 DP4 Decode 节点分别为 DP rank `0/1/2/3` 使用 "
"`4/5/6/7`，在模板中计算为 `$4 + 4`。这些 lookup 标识符标识本地 IPC 端点，而不是 PP rank 或 MemCache "
"注册 rank。"

msgid ""
"The 950DT Products pooled templates enable DSpark3. Fill in the local "
"directory of a draft checkpoint compatible with the 950DT Products target "
"model. Use the same draft checkpoint on both roles, with draft TP `1/8` on "
"Prefill/Decode matching each target TP, three speculative tokens, draft "
"`enforce_eager=false`, and `kv_cache_dtype=auto`. The Prefill target model "
"retains `--enforce-eager`. Model, cache, quantization, and scheduling "
"settings follow [Section 5.1.1](#511-create-the-engine-templates); only "
"maximum length and pool configuration change. Configure optional reasoning "
"and tool-call flags as described in [Section 5.1.1](#511-create-the-engine-"
"templates), using `kimi_k3` parsers."
msgstr ""
"Ascend 950DT系列产品的池化模板启用 DSpark3。请填写与 Ascend "
"950DT系列产品目标模型兼容的草稿检查点的本地目录。在两个角色上使用相同的草稿检查点，Prefill/Decode 上的草稿 TP 分别为 "
"`1/8`，与各自的目标 TP 匹配，使用三个投机 token、草稿 `enforce_eager=false` 和 "
"`kv_cache_dtype=auto`。Prefill 目标模型保留 `--enforce-eager`。模型、缓存、量化和调度设置遵循[第 "
"5.1.1 节](#511-create-the-engine-templates)；仅最大长度和池配置发生变化。按照[第 5.1.1 "
"节](#511-create-the-engine-templates)所述，使用 `kimi_k3` 解析器配置可选的推理和工具调用标志。"

msgid "=== \"Prefill\""
msgstr "=== \"Prefill\""

msgid ""
"Save the Prefill template below as `run_dp_template.sh`. Fill in the local "
"IP, NIC, model paths, KV/HCCL ports, and the top-level `API_PORT`, "
"`NODE_RANK`, `MASTER_ADDR`, and `MASTER_PORT` variables, then start it "
"directly with Bash. The script automatically sets `--headless` on P1–P3."
msgstr ""
"将下面的 Prefill 模板保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。填写本地 IP、网卡、模型路径、KV/HCCL 端口，以及顶层的 "
"`API_PORT`、`NODE_RANK`、`MASTER_ADDR` 和 `MASTER_PORT` 变量，然后直接使用 Bash 启动。脚本会在 "
"P1–P3 上自动设置 `--headless`。"

msgid "=== \"Decode\""
msgstr "=== \"Decode\""

msgid ""
"Save the Pooled Decode template below as `run_dp_template.sh` on the "
"corresponding nodes. Fill in the local IP, network interface, KV port, and "
"target and draft model paths, and replace `<PROFILER_OUTPUT_DIR>` with a "
"writable profiling output directory."
msgstr ""
"将下面的池化 Decode 模板保存为相应节点上的 `run_dp_template.sh`。填写本地 IP、网络接口、KV "
"端口以及目标和草稿模型路径，并将 `<PROFILER_OUTPUT_DIR>` 替换为可写的性能分析输出目录。"

msgid ""
"#### 5.3.6 Start the Engines and Proxy {#536-start-the-engines-and-proxy}"
msgstr "#### 5.3.6 启动引擎和 Proxy {#536-start-the-engines-and-proxy}"

msgid ""
"Before starting pooled engines, ensure MetaService and all eight standalone "
"providers are ready. Use the pooled templates in this section, which load "
"`runtime_env.sh` and the client configuration. Keep A3 Prefill "
"`<PREFILL_DP_RPC_PORT>` identical on all four P nodes and distinct from "
"`MASTER_PORT`; Prefill DP rank remains `0`."
msgstr ""
"在启动池化引擎之前，请确保 MetaService 和全部八个独立 provider 已就绪。使用本节中的池化模板，这些模板会加载 "
"`runtime_env.sh` 和客户端配置。在所有四个 P 节点上保持 A3 Prefill `<PREFILL_DP_RPC_PORT>` "
"一致，并确保其与 `MASTER_PORT` 不同；Prefill DP rank 保持为 `0`。"

msgid "**Start Prefill (P0–P3)**"
msgstr "**启动 Prefill（P0–P3）**"

msgid ""
"Save the matching Prefill template as `run_dp_template.sh` on each P node, "
"fill in its variables, and run it directly without positional arguments. "
"This deployment uses DP=1 and PP=4 on Prefill, with one PP stage per node."
msgstr ""
"将匹配的 Prefill 模板保存为每个 P 节点上的 `run_dp_template.sh`，填写其变量，并直接运行，无需位置参数。此部署在 "
"Prefill 上使用 DP=1 和 PP=4，每个节点一个 PP 阶段。"

msgid ""
"This A3 deployment uses DP=1, PP=4, TP=4, and PCP=4 on Prefill, with 16 NPU "
"devices per node."
msgstr "此 A3 部署在 Prefill 上使用 DP=1、PP=4、TP=4 和 PCP=4，每个节点有 16 个 NPU 设备。"

msgid "| Prefill script variable | Configuration |"
msgstr "| Prefill 脚本变量 | 配置 |"

msgid ""
"    | `NODE_RANK` | Set to `0, 1, 2, 3` on P0–P3 respectively; this is the "
"PP node rank. |"
msgstr "    | `NODE_RANK` | 在 P0–P3 上分别设置为 `0, 1, 2, 3`；这是 PP 节点 rank。 |"

msgid "    | `MASTER_ADDR` | Use the P0 IP on all four P nodes. |"
msgstr "    | `MASTER_ADDR` | 在所有四个 P 节点上使用 P0 的 IP。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `MASTER_PORT` | Use the same Prefill master port on all four P nodes. "
"|"
msgstr "    | `MASTER_PORT` | 在所有四个 P 节点上使用相同的 Prefill master 端口。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `API_PORT` | P0 API listening port; register the P0 IP and port with "
"the Proxy. P1–P3 use `--headless` and do not expose an API service. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `API_PORT` | P0 API 监听端口；将 P0 的 IP 和端口注册到 Proxy。P1–P3 使用 "
"`--headless`，不暴露 API 服务。 |"

msgid ""
"The template automatically adds `--headless` on P1–P3. Start P0 before "
"P1–P3, keeping model paths, layer partitioning, and parallelism settings "
"consistent across all four P nodes."
msgstr ""
"模板会在 P1–P3 上自动添加 `--headless`。请先启动 P0，再启动 P1–P3，并确保所有四个 P "
"节点上的模型路径、层划分和并行设置保持一致。"

msgid "**Start Decode (D0–D3)**"
msgstr "**启动 Decode（D0–D3）**"

msgid ""
"Deploy `launch_online_dp.py` on the D nodes and save the matching Decode "
"template as `run_dp_template.sh` in the same directory. Run the following "
"command from that directory to start one DP instance per node:"
msgstr ""
"在 D 节点上部署 `launch_online_dp.py`，并将匹配的 Decode 模板保存为同一目录下的 "
"`run_dp_template.sh`。从该目录运行以下命令，以在每个节点上启动一个 DP 实例："

msgid ""
"This guide uses the repository launcher that passes seven positional "
"arguments. DCP is explicitly set in the Decode template: `16` for A3 and `8`"
" for 950DT Products. Use a launcher that matches the template; do not "
"substitute versions that pass parameters through `$8` or "
"`AICLUSTERHUB_PCP_SIZE` / `AICLUSTERHUB_DCP_SIZE` without adapting the "
"template."
msgstr ""
"本指南使用传递七个位置参数的仓库启动器。DCP 在 Decode 模板中显式设置：A3 为 `16`，Ascend 950DT系列产品为 "
"`8`。请使用与模板匹配的启动器；不要替换为通过 `$8` 或 `AICLUSTERHUB_PCP_SIZE` / "
"`AICLUSTERHUB_DCP_SIZE` 传递参数且未适配模板的版本。"

msgid ""
"Set `<DECODE_DP_RANK>` to `0, 1, 2, 3` on D0–D3 respectively. Use the D0 IP "
"for `<DECODE_MASTER_IP>` and the same `<DECODE_DP_RPC_PORT>` on all four D "
"nodes. Set `<DECODE_API_PORT>` to each node's actual API port. Start D0 "
"before D1–D3."
msgstr ""
"在 D0–D3 上分别将 `<DECODE_DP_RANK>` 设置为 `0, 1, 2, 3`。将 `<DECODE_MASTER_IP>` 设置为 "
"D0 的 IP，并在所有四个 D 节点上使用相同的 `<DECODE_DP_RPC_PORT>`。将 `<DECODE_API_PORT>` "
"设置为每个节点的实际 API 端口。请先启动 D0，再启动 D1–D3。"

msgid ""
"The launcher still passes Decode arguments `$1`–`$7`: device list, API port,"
" DP size, DP rank, Decode master IP, DP RPC port, and TP size. Configure "
"master addresses and ports separately for P and D, and register the actual "
"API endpoints with the Proxy."
msgstr ""
"启动器仍会传递 Decode 参数 `$1`–`$7`：设备列表、API 端口、DP 大小、DP rank、Decode master IP、DP "
"RPC 端口和 TP 大小。请分别为 P 和 D 配置 master 地址和端口，并将实际的 API 端点注册到 Proxy。"

msgid ""
"The supplied lookup identifiers are `33101` on Prefill and `33501` on "
"Decode, separate from the Mooncake KV ports `33100` and `33500`. "
"`lookup_rpc_port` identifies the local pool scheduler/worker IPC endpoint; "
"it is not the MetaService address, PP node rank, or an automatically "
"assigned MemCache registration rank. One instance per separate host can "
"reuse its role's identifier. Give additional instances on the same host "
"distinct identifiers and non-conflicting service ports."
msgstr ""
"所提供的 lookup 标识符在 Prefill 上为 `33101`，在 Decode 上为 `33501`，与 Mooncake KV 端口 "
"`33100` 和 `33500` 相互独立。`lookup_rpc_port` 标识本地池调度器/worker 的 IPC 端点；它不是 "
"MetaService 地址、PP 节点 rank，也不是自动分配的 MemCache 注册 "
"rank。每台独立主机上的一个实例可以复用其角色的标识符。同一主机上的其他实例必须使用不同的标识符和不冲突的服务端口。"

msgid ""
"Once P0 and all four Decode APIs are ready, start the Proxy with the command"
" in [Section 5.1.2](#512-start-the-engines-and-proxy), registering only P0 "
"as the prefiller and D0–D3 as decoders. Use their actual API ports. Clients "
"use the same `kimi-k3.1-pro` name through the Proxy."
msgstr ""
"当 P0 和全部四个 Decode API 就绪后，使用 [第 5.1.2 节](#512-start-the-engines-and-"
"proxy)中的命令启动 Proxy，仅将 P0 注册为 prefiller，将 D0–D3 注册为 decoder。使用它们实际的 API "
"端口。客户端通过 Proxy 使用相同的 `kimi-k3.1-pro` 名称。"

msgid "| Setting | A3 pooled Prefill | A3 pooled Decode |"
msgstr "| 设置 | A3 池化 Prefill | A3 池化 Decode |"

msgid "    | DP / TP / PP | `1 / 4 / 4` | `4 / 16 / 1` |"
msgstr "    | DP / TP / PP | `1 / 4 / 4` | `4 / 16 / 1` |"

msgid "    | PCP / DCP | `4 / 1` | `1 / 16` |"
msgstr "    | PCP / DCP | `4 / 1` | `1 / 16` |"

msgid "    | Maximum model length | `1048576` | `1048576` |"
msgstr "    | 最大模型长度 | `1048576` | `1048576` |"

msgid ""
"    | Block size / CP interleave | `768` / not explicitly set | `768 / 768` "
"|"
msgstr "    | Block 大小 / CP 交错 | `768` / 未显式设置 | `768 / 768` |"

msgid "    | Main / indexer cache dtype | `int8 / int8` | `int8 / int8` |"
msgstr "    | 主缓存 / indexer 缓存 dtype | `int8 / int8` | `int8 / int8` |"

msgid "    | Batched tokens / maximum sequences | `8192 / 32` | `8192 / 32` |"
msgstr "    | 批处理 token 数 / 最大序列数 | `8192 / 32` | `8192 / 32` |"

msgid "    | GPU memory utilization | `0.90` | `0.80` |"
msgstr "    | GPU 显存利用率 | `0.90` | `0.80` |"

msgid "    | Graph mode | Eager | `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` |"
msgstr "    | 图模式 | Eager | `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` |"

msgid "    | DSpark tokens / draft TP | `3 / 4` | `3 / 16` |"
msgstr "    | DSpark token 数 / draft TP | `3 / 4` | `3 / 16` |"

msgid "    | Draft cache / eager | `bfloat16 / true` | `bfloat16 / false` |"
msgstr "    | Draft 缓存 / eager | `bfloat16 / true` | `bfloat16 / false` |"

msgid ""
"    | `enable_flashcomm1` / shared-expert DP | `true / true` | Not "
"explicitly set |"
msgstr ""
"    | `enable_flashcomm1` / shared-expert DP | `true / true` | 未显式设置 |"

msgid ""
"    | Shared-expert overlap / MLAPO | `false` / not explicitly set | `true /"
" true` |"
msgstr "    | Shared-expert 重叠 / MLAPO | `false` / 未显式设置 | `true / true` |"

msgid "    | Allocator expandable segments | `True` | `False` |"
msgstr "    | 分配器可扩展段 | `True` | `False` |"

msgid ""
"    | Pool backend / layerwise | `memcache / false` | `memcache / false` |"
msgstr "    | 池后端 / layerwise | `memcache / false` | `memcache / false` |"

msgid "    | Pool role | `kv_producer` | `kv_consumer` |"
msgstr "    | 池角色 | `kv_producer` | `kv_consumer` |"

msgid ""
"The pooled reference has different sequence limits, FlashComm/shared-expert "
"settings, and allocator settings from the basic A3 templates. Keep the "
"pooled template's settings together rather than replacing only the connector"
" in [Section 5.1](#51-pd-deployment)."
msgstr ""
"池化参考配置在序列限制、FlashComm/shared-expert 设置以及分配器设置方面与基础 A3 "
"模板不同。请保持池化模板的设置整体一致，而不是仅在 [第 5.1 节](#51-pd-deployment)中替换 connector。"

msgid ""
"Start MetaService as described in [Section 5.3.3](#533-start-metaservice). "
"In the prepared model and MF runtime environment on each P/D node, replace "
"the path below with the absolute path of the local configuration prepared in"
" [Section 5.3.2](#532-prepare-the-memcache-configuration-files) and run it "
"in the actual launch shell:"
msgstr ""
"按照 [第 5.3.3 节](#533-start-metaservice)所述启动 MetaService。在每个 P/D 节点上已准备好的模型和 "
"MF 运行时环境中，将下面的路径替换为在 [第 5.3.2 节](#532-prepare-the-memcache-configuration-"
"files)中准备的本地配置的绝对路径，并在实际启动 shell 中运行："

msgid ""
"In the same shell, follow [Section 5.1.2](#512-start-the-engines-and-proxy) "
"to start P/D and the Proxy using the pooled templates: direct Bash for "
"Prefill and the matching Python launcher for Decode. Child processes inherit"
" the environment variable. If an existing environment script sets it, reuse "
"that setting after verifying that it points to the local node configuration."
msgstr ""
"在同一 shell 中，按照 [第 5.1.2 节](#512-start-the-engines-and-proxy)使用池化模板启动 P/D 和 "
"Proxy：Prefill 使用直接 Bash 方式，Decode 使用对应的 Python "
"启动器。子进程会继承该环境变量。如果现有环境脚本已设置该变量，请在确认其指向本地节点配置后复用该设置。"

msgid ""
"Keep maximum length `172032` on both roles. Lookup identifiers are `0` on "
"P0–P3 and `4, 5, 6, 7` on D0–D3. P1–P3 use `--headless`; register only P0 "
"and the four Decode APIs with the Proxy."
msgstr ""
"两个角色均保持最大长度 `172032`。Lookup 标识符在 P0–P3 上为 `0`，在 D0–D3 上为 `4, 5, 6, 7`。P1–P3 "
"使用 `--headless`；仅将 P0 和四个 Decode API 注册到 Proxy。"

msgid ""
"#### 5.3.7 Verify the Pool and Model Service {#537-verify-the-pool-and-"
"model-service}"
msgstr "#### 5.3.7 验证池和模型服务 {#537-verify-the-pool-and-model-service}"

msgid "=== \"A3 series\""
msgstr "=== \"A3系列\""

msgid ""
"The registered capacities below assume the reference configuration of 1 GiB "
"per provider. After changing DRAM capacity, verify registration against the "
"actual configuration rather than a fixed 8 GiB total."
msgstr ""
"以下注册容量基于每个 provider 1 GiB 的参考配置。更改 DRAM 容量后，请根据实际配置验证注册情况，而不是固定的 8 GiB 总量。"

msgid ""
"Check the current provider PID and its current initialization log on every "
"node. Query the configured MetaService, bypassing HTTP proxies:"
msgstr "在每个节点上检查当前 provider 的 PID 及其当前初始化日志。绕过 HTTP 代理，查询已配置的 MetaService："

msgid ""
"For the eight-provider 1 GiB reference, expect eight DRAM segments of "
"`1073741824` bytes and a total of `8589934592` bytes. MemCache registration "
"ranks are dynamic; do not map a segment rank directly to a model P/D rank. "
"MetaService metrics establish provider registration and capacity, not model-"
"side cache hits."
msgstr ""
"对于八个 provider、每个 1 GiB 的参考配置，预期有八个 `1073741824` 字节的 DRAM 段，总计 `8589934592` "
"字节。MemCache 注册 rank 是动态的；不要将段 rank 直接映射到模型 P/D rank。MetaService 指标只能确认 "
"provider 注册和容量，不能确认模型侧的缓存命中。"

msgid ""
"After the engines and Proxy are ready, send the text and multimodal requests"
" in [Section 6](#6-functional-verification) using `kimi-k3.1-pro`. Inspect "
"the active engine configuration for `MultiConnector`, `backend=memcache`, "
"`use_layerwise=false`, and the client `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`. Repeat a "
"request with the same sufficiently long prefix and correlate the engine's "
"external-cache lookup/load/save logs or metrics with the request and the "
"returned output. Local prefix caching is also enabled; a faster repeated "
"request alone does not prove a MemCache hit."
msgstr ""
"引擎和 Proxy 就绪后，使用 `kimi-k3.1-pro` 发送 [第 6 节](#6-functional-"
"verification)中的文本和多模态请求。检查当前生效的引擎配置中的 "
"`MultiConnector`、`backend=memcache`、`use_layerwise=false` 以及客户端的 "
"`MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`。使用相同且足够长的前缀重复发送请求，并将引擎的外部缓存 lookup/load/save "
"日志或指标与请求及返回的输出进行关联。本地前缀缓存也已启用；仅凭重复请求变快并不能证明发生了 MemCache 命中。"

msgid ""
"Validate model-side pool reuse, output correctness, and accuracy before "
"recording the deployment as accepted. Measure performance separately with "
"the same runtime, topology, and cache state. Starting the provider or "
"passing `bash -n` does not establish those results."
msgstr ""
"在将部署记录为验收通过之前，请验证模型侧的池复用、输出正确性和精度。使用相同的运行时、拓扑和缓存状态单独测量性能。启动 provider 或通过 "
"`bash -n` 并不能证明上述结果。"

msgid "=== \"950DT Products\""
msgstr "=== \"Ascend 950DT系列产品\""

msgid ""
"Do not apply the A3 eight-standalone-provider or 8 GiB registration criteria"
" to 950DT Products. Inspect MetaService and actual engine/worker logs for "
"the effective `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`, the matching node configuration "
"adjusted to available capacity (reference value: `1GB`), cache "
"initialization, and observed registered capacity. Do not infer registration "
"from node count alone. Then validate request outputs and external-cache "
"reuse through the Proxy, recording accuracy and performance separately."
msgstr ""
"不要将 A3 的八个独立 provider 或 8 GiB 注册标准应用于 Ascend 950DT系列产品。请检查 MetaService "
"和实际的引擎/worker 日志，以确认生效的 "
"`MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`、按可用容量调整后的匹配节点配置（参考值：`1GB`）、缓存初始化以及观察到的注册容量。不要仅根据节点数量推断注册情况。然后通过"
" Proxy 验证请求输出和外部缓存复用，并分别记录精度和性能。"

msgid "## 6 Functional Verification {#6-functional-verification}"
msgstr "## 6 功能验证 {#6-functional-verification}"

msgid ""
"### 6.1 Text and Multimodal Requests {#61-text-and-multimodal-requests}"
msgstr "### 6.1 文本和多模态请求 {#61-text-and-multimodal-requests}"

msgid ""
"Once the P/D engines and Proxy are ready, replace `<PROXY_IP>` and "
"`<PROXY_PORT>` with the actual service address and the port used to start "
"the Proxy. Both the request's `model` field and `--served-model-name` are "
"`kimi-k3.1-pro`."
msgstr ""
"P/D 引擎和 Proxy 就绪后，将 `<PROXY_IP>` 和 `<PROXY_PORT>` 替换为实际的服务地址和启动 Proxy "
"时使用的端口。请求的 `model` 字段和 `--served-model-name` 均为 `kimi-k3.1-pro`。"

msgid ""
"Image request example (replace `<IMAGE_URL_OR_DATA_URL>` with an accessible "
"image URL or a valid image data URL):"
msgstr "图像请求示例（将 `<IMAGE_URL_OR_DATA_URL>` 替换为可访问的图像 URL 或有效的图像 data URL）："

msgid ""
"The request should return HTTP 200, with generated content in the response's"
" `choices` field. For image requests, the response should match the image. "
"If generation stops at the output token limit, adjust the output budget for "
"the reasoning mode in use."
msgstr ""
"请求应返回 HTTP 200，生成内容位于响应的 `choices` 字段中。对于图像请求，响应内容应与图像相符。如果生成在输出 token "
"上限处停止，请调整当前所用推理模式的输出预算。"

msgid "## 7 Accuracy Evaluation {#7-accuracy-evaluation}"
msgstr "## 7 精度评测 {#7-accuracy-evaluation}"

msgid ""
"The following accuracy results were reported for Kimi K3.1 Pro with PD "
"separation."
msgstr "以下为 Kimi K3.1 Pro 在 PD 分离场景下的精度结果。"

