msgstr "| dataset | version | metric | mode | vllm-api-general-chat | note |"

msgid "### 7.1 Using AISBench {#71-using-aisbench}"
msgstr "### 7.1 使用 AISBench {#71-using-aisbench}"

msgid ""
"1. Refer to the [AISBench guide](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md) to prepare the environment and evaluation configuration.\n"
"2. Run evaluation through the Proxy API and save the configuration, generated outputs, and evaluation report.\n"
"3. When comparing results, keep the model and tokenizer revisions, chat template, sampling settings, output length, dataset, and evaluation-tool version fixed."
msgstr ""
"1. 参考 [AISBench 指南](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md) 准备环境和评测配置。\n"
"2. 通过 Proxy API 运行评测，并保存配置、生成输出和评测报告。\n"
"3. 对比结果时，请保持模型和 tokenizer 版本、chat template、采样设置、输出长度、数据集和评测工具版本一致。"

msgid "## 8 Performance Evaluation {#8-performance-evaluation}"
msgstr "## 8 性能评测 {#8-performance-evaluation}"

msgid "### 8.1 Using AISBench {#81-using-aisbench}"
msgstr "### 8.1 使用 AISBench {#81-using-aisbench}"

msgid ""
"Refer to the [AISBench performance evaluation "
"guide](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-"
"performance-evaluation) to prepare the environment and test configuration."
msgstr ""
"参考 [AISBench "
"性能评测指南](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-"
"performance-evaluation) 准备环境和测试配置。"

msgid "### 8.2 Using vLLM Benchmark {#82-using-vllm-benchmark}"
msgstr "### 8.2 使用 vLLM Benchmark {#82-using-vllm-benchmark}"

msgid ""
"The following minimal random-text benchmark sends 16 requests through the "
"Proxy with concurrency 1, 1024 input tokens, and 128 output tokens. Replace "
"the service address with the actual Proxy endpoint, set `<LOCAL_MODEL_PATH>`"
" to the platform checkpoint directory accessible to the benchmark client, "
"and choose a writable results directory."
msgstr ""
"以下最小化随机文本基准测试通过 Proxy 发送 16 个请求，并发为 1，输入 token 为 1024，输出 token 为 "
"128。请将服务地址替换为实际的 Proxy 端点，将 `<LOCAL_MODEL_PATH>` "
"设置为基准测试客户端可访问的平台权重目录，并选择一个可写的结果目录。"

msgid ""
"After a successful run, check that 16 requests succeeded and record request "
"throughput (requests/s), output-token throughput (tokens/s), time to first "
"token (TTFT, ms), and time per output token after the first (TPOT, ms). "
"Result files are saved under `--result-dir`. This small workload verifies "
"the benchmark procedure; adjust lengths, concurrency, and request count to "
"represent the target workload."
msgstr ""
"运行成功后，请确认 16 个请求均成功，并记录请求吞吐量（requests/s）、输出 token 吞吐量（tokens/s）、首 token "
"时延（TTFT，ms）以及首个输出 token 之后的每 token 时延（TPOT，ms）。结果文件保存在 `--result-dir` "
"下。此小规模负载用于验证基准测试流程；请调整长度、并发数和请求数，以代表目标负载。"

msgid ""
"See the [vLLM Benchmark "
"guide](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/performance_benchmark.md)"
" for more parameters, and check options using `vllm bench serve --help` from"
" the installed version. Keep test data, concurrency, lengths, cache state, "
"and metric definitions consistent when comparing results, and save the "
"commands used."
msgstr ""
"更多参数请参见 [vLLM Benchmark "
"指南](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/performance_benchmark.md)，并使用已安装版本的"
" `vllm bench serve --help` 查看选项。对比结果时，请保持测试数据、并发数、长度、缓存状态和指标定义一致，并保存所使用的命令。"

