msgid "## 10 FAQ {#10-faq}"
msgstr "## 10 常见问题 {#10-faq}"

msgid ""
"For common environment, installation, and parameter questions, refer to the "
"[public FAQ](../../faqs.md)."
msgstr "有关环境、安装和参数的常见问题，请参考 [公共 FAQ](../../faqs.md)。"

msgid ""
"- **Q: Which multimodal inputs are supported by the current Kimi K3.1 Pro "
"implementation?** A: This guide provides configuration and verification "
"examples for image input. See [Section 6](#6-functional-verification)."
msgstr ""
"- **问：当前 Kimi K3.1 Pro 实现支持哪些多模态输入？** 答：本指南提供了图像输入的配置和验证示例。请参见 [第 6 "
"节](#6-functional-verification)。"

msgid ""
"- **Q: Which server options are required for Kimi K3.1 Pro reasoning and "
"tool calling?** A: Configure `--tokenizer-mode`, `--enable-auto-tool-"
"choice`, `--reasoning-parser`, and `--tool-call-parser` together. Use "
"`kimi_k3` for the tokenizer and parsers on both A3 and 950DT Products."
msgstr ""
"- **问：Kimi K3.1 Pro 的推理和工具调用需要哪些服务端选项？** 答：需同时配置 `--tokenizer-"
"mode`、`--enable-auto-tool-choice`、`--reasoning-parser` 和 `--tool-call-"
"parser`。在 Atlas A3系列产品和 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，tokenizer 和解析器均使用 `kimi_k3`。"

msgid ""
"- **Q: How should TP size be selected?** A: The attention-head count in the "
"checkpoint must be divisible by TP size. TP also changes the KDA state "
"layout and expert placement; check memory requirements and communication "
"performance together."
msgstr ""
"- **问：如何选择 TP 大小？** 答：权重中的注意力头数必须能被 TP 大小整除。TP 还会改变 KDA "
"状态布局和专家分布；请同时检查内存需求和通信性能。"

msgid ""
"- **Q: How is DSpark enabled in PD separation?** A: Prepare a DSpark draft "
"checkpoint compatible with the target model on this platform and replace "
"`<YOUR_DRAFT_MODEL_PATH>` in both templates with its local directory. Apply "
"the role-specific `--speculative-config` from Section [5.1](#51-pd-"
"deployment), [5.2](#52-long-context), or [5.3](#53-pooled-pd). Keep the "
"draft checkpoint and `num_speculative_tokens` identical on both sides, and "
"retain `--enforce-eager` for the Prefill target model."
msgstr ""
"- **问：在 PD 分离场景中如何启用 DSpark？** 答：请准备一个与该平台上目标模型兼容的 DSpark draft 权重，并将两个模板中的 "
"`<YOUR_DRAFT_MODEL_PATH>` 替换为其本地目录。应用 [5.1](#51-pd-"
"deployment)、[5.2](#52-long-context) 或 [5.3](#53-pooled-pd) 节中对应角色的 "
"`--speculative-config`。两侧的 draft 权重和 `num_speculative_tokens` 必须保持一致，并为 "
"Prefill 目标模型保留 `--enforce-eager`。"

msgid ""
"- **Q: Which option is required for multimodal image input?** A: Add `--no-"
"mm-device-do-normalize` to every engine startup command, including Prefill, "
"Decode, and headless workers. This keeps image pixel rescaling and "
"normalization on the CPU, because the current Ascend Kimi vision wrapper "
"does not apply device-side normalization. Omitting this option can degrade "
"image accuracy."
msgstr ""
"- **问：多模态图像输入需要哪个选项？** 答：在每个引擎启动命令中添加 `--no-mm-device-do-normalize`，包括 "
"Prefill、Decode 和无头 worker。这样可将图像像素重缩放和归一化保留在 CPU 上，因为当前的昇腾 Kimi "
"视觉封装不会在设备侧执行归一化。省略此选项可能会降低图像精度。"
